+## Phase 1 ΓÇö Foundation (Database + Auth + Layout)
+
+> **Goal:** A working login, role-based redirect, and sidebar shell. Nothing else yet.
+
+### Build Order:
+1. **Laravel Project Setup** ΓåÆ `laravel new ztg-pos`, configure `.env` for MySQL
+2. **Database Migrations** ΓåÆ Run in this order (foreign keys depend on earlier tables):
+   - `users` ΓåÆ employees/auth (seed `EMP-000` Administrator)
+   - `categories` ΓåÆ product categories
+   - `settings` ΓåÆ key-value config store
+3. **Auth System** ΓåÆ Laravel Sanctum + login/logout API
+4. **React Project Setup** ΓåÆ Vite + React Router
+5. **Login Page** ΓåÆ POST `/api/login`, store token, redirect by role
+6. **Layout Shell** ΓåÆ Sidebar component with role-based nav items
+7. **RBAC Middleware** ΓåÆ Laravel middleware to check `Admin`, `Cashier`, etc.
+
+### Γ£à Test Checkpoint:
+- [ ] Can login as Admin ΓåÆ see Dashboard shell with full sidebar
+- [ ] Can login as Cashier ΓåÆ see POS shell with limited sidebar  
+- [ ] Invalid credentials ΓåÆ error message
+- [ ] No token ΓåÆ redirected to login
