+## Phase 5 ΓÇö History Logs (Refund / Return / Void)
+
+> **Why fourth?** Post-sale operations. Requires completed transactions from Phase 4 to exist.
+
+### Build Order:
+1. **Transaction List Page** ΓåÆ Filterable table of all transactions
+2. **Refund Modal** ΓåÆ Select items, choose reason, approve with PIN
+3. **Return Modal** ΓåÆ Same flow, different status outcome
+4. **Void Modal** ΓåÆ Voids entire transaction, admin PIN required
+5. **PIN Validation Service** ΓåÆ Verify admin/supervisor PIN, log failures
+6. **Stock Restoration Logic** ΓåÆ Re-add stock on refund/void
+7. **Damaged Mark Logic** ΓåÆ Move refunded items to damaged count
+8. **Daily Void Limit** ΓåÆ Configurable max voids per day
+9. **Audit Detail Modal** ΓåÆ Full transaction history view
+10. **OR Generation** ΓåÆ Official Receipt for refund/return/void
+
+### Γ£à Test Checkpoint:
+- [ ] Can refund a completed sale ΓåÆ stock restored, status = "Refund"
