+## Module E: History Logs (Refund / Return / Void)
+
+### Transaction Status Lifecycle
+```
+                    ΓöîΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ Refund (partial/full item refund)
+                    Γöé
+Completed ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓö╝ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ Return (exchange/store credit)
+                    Γöé
+                    ΓööΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ Void (cancel entire transaction)
+
+Deposit ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓö¼ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ Completed (reservation fulfilled)
+Paid ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÿ
+
+Restocked ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ (standalone ΓÇö inventory event)
+Damaged ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ (standalone ΓÇö inventory event)
+Security Alert ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ (standalone ΓÇö failed PIN log)
+```
+
+### Refund/Return Submit Logic
+```
+INPUT:
+  transaction_index, refund_type ("Refund" or "Return"),
+  selected_items[], reason, approver_id, approval_pin,
+  restore_stock (bool), mark_damaged (bool)
+
+VALIDATION:
+  1. Verify approver PIN against users table
+  2. Check daily void limit not exceeded
+  3. At least one item must be checked
+
+PROCESSING (inside DB transaction):
+  FOR EACH checked item:
+    IF restore_stock:
+      product.stock += refund_qty
+    IF mark_damaged:
+      product.damaged += refund_qty
+  
+  UPDATE transaction:
+    status = refund_type  ("Refund" or "Return")
+    refund_reason = selected_reason
+    action_type = "Refunded via {method}" or "Exchange / Store Credit"
+    inv_action = "Restocked to Shelf" and/or "Moved to Scrap/Damaged"
+    approver = approver.name
+    approval_code = pin
+    or_no = "OR-RFD-{timestamp}" or "OR-RTN-{timestamp}"
+    amount = recalculated from checked items * 1.12 (VAT inclusive)
+  
+  GENERATE Official Receipt (PDF)
+```
+
+### Void Submit Logic
+```
+INPUT:
+  transaction_index, void_reason, admin_id, admin_pin,
+  restore_stock (bool)
+
+VALIDATION:
+  1. Verify admin PIN
+  2. Check daily void limit
+
+PROCESSING:
+  IF restore_stock:
+    FOR EACH item in original transaction:
+      product.stock += item.qty
+  
+  UPDATE transaction:
+    status = "Void"
+    void_reason = reason
+    approver = admin.name
+    approval_code = pin
+    or_no = "OR-VOID-{timestamp}"
+    inv_action = restore_stock ? "Restocked to Shelf" : "No Stock Restoration"
+  
+  GENERATE Void Notice (PDF)
+```
+
+### Refund Reasons (Predefined)
+```
+- Item Damaged / Defective
+- Wrong Item Given
+- Customer Changed Mind
+- Overcharged / Pricing Error
+- Duplicate Transaction
+- Other / Custom Reason
+```
+
+### Void Reasons (Predefined)
+```
+- Wrong Transaction / Input Error
+- Customer Cancelled Before Release
+- Duplicate Entry
+- System/Technical Error
+```
+
+### Security Alert on Failed PIN
